info.description:
Laravel 11 schools platform. Base path /api/v1. Response envelope: { success, message, data }.

Auth: Laravel Sanctum bearer tokens.
- {{user_token}} - obtained from POST /v1/auth/login (end users / students).
- {{admin_token}} - obtained from POST /v1/auth/admin/login (administrators).

Common error shapes:
- 401 Unauthenticated: { "message": "Unauthenticated." }
- 403 Forbidden (EnsureIsAdmin / EnsureSuperAdmin): { "success": false, "message": "unauthorized", "data": null }
- 404 Not Found (route-model binding): { "message": "No query results for model ..." }
- 409 Conflict (ResourceInUseException): { "success": false, "message": "Resource is still in use.", "data": null }
- 422 Validation: { "message": "...", "errors": { "field": ["..."] } }
- 429 Too Many Requests: { "success": false, "message": "Too many requests. Try again in 60 seconds." }

